296123_2001555263777483_7751305571821604775_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WCvacMnJHEwQ7kNvwFPWKbY&_nc_oc=AdrjGct6l81iWjN0YbfWAZ1CIU2tkHtGsTIHepiFAYh_CJ47YczpaO1mDyWkOBjXVQU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWcnyIV5U-aLLjrXKCHAnXe4MxrPqpf7wfnz9FZ8c31dg&oe=6B0F111D"}, "display_name": "Compass", "keywords": ["open", "world", "flying", "cute", "grapple"], "long_description": "                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          \n{1286261207054090}\n\n**Compass** is an open-world VR flying adventure set among otherworldly skies.\nYou are a scout flying ahead of a wandering Caravan, charting safe routes through unknown skies.\n\n\n\n# RIDE THE CLOUDS\n{1681112086404919}\nTake control of your flying vessel and travel across vast open skies filled with changing environments. Upgrade your ship to venture farther and get through dangerous routes.\n\n\n# COMPLETE CHALLENGES\n{1158286549797869}\nLeave the cockpit and use your hand grapples to swing through ruins, climb structures, and complete environmental challenges scattered across the skies.\n\n\n# SCOUT THE UNKNOWN\n{3135182253350722}\nExplore new regions, recover lost cargo, meet the people living among the clouds, and search for signs of your missing companions as you discover what lies beyond the horizon.", "short_description": "Explore long lost skies in Compass, an open-world piloting adventure about finding your way through uncharted clouds. Maneuver your ship through hazardous floating landscapes, solve puzzles with your grapples, upgrade your vessel, and lead the Caravan forward."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://trebuchet.fun/en/page/privacy-policy-compass", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher